    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like evolution. it feels like a decline. i look at my old stuff and i know i'll never touch that level of brilliance again. it's just depressing to watch yourself become a lesser version of who you used to be. i'd rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
